      "role": "user",
      "content": "i like the direction, but the progressive character feels a bit too much like a caricature. they sound like they're just yelling about bureaucracy. can u make their argument more sophisticated? like, give them some actual policy points or social justice reasoning so they sound like they have a legitimate, well-thought-out point of view, even if they're being intense. \n\nand for the traditionalist, maybe make them sound a bit more stuck in their ways—like they're just resisting change for the sake of it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
